{"symbol":"IZS.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T23:07:59Z","info":{"address1":"ul. Opolska 29","city":"Kolonowskie","zip":"47-113","country":"Poland","phone":"48 77 405 6500","fax":"48 77 405 6501","website":"https://www.izostal.com.pl","industry":"Steel","industryKey":"steel","industryDisp":"Steel","sector":"Basic Materials","sectorKey":"basic-materials","sectorDisp":"Basic Materials","longBusinessSummary":"Izostal S.A. manufactures and distributes steel pipes in Poland, European Union, Europe, and internationally. The company operates in two segments, Steel and Infrastructure. It offers anticorrosive coatings, including three layer polyethylene and polypropylene, as well as internal coating for gas and fuels transportation, drinking water, and sewage water; and steel pipes, such as seamless, welded with high frequency current, spiral-welded, and longitudinally welded. The company also provides metallurgical products comprising sheets, channels, flange I-beams, angles, angles-hollow sections, flat bars, ribbed bars, T bars, and wire rods; and gas fixtures. In addition, it engages in the infrastructure of gas and other media transmission networks; anti-corrosion insulation services; steel processing; and trading of steel products. The company was founded in 1993 and is headquartered in Kolonowskie, Poland. Izostal S.A. operates as a subsidiary of Stalprofil S.A.","fullTimeEmployees":328,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Marek  Mazurek","title":"President of the Management Board & General Director","fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":2343000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Michal  Pietrek","title":"Vice-President of Management Board & Commercial Director","fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":1918000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Marek  Matheja","title":"Chief Accountant & Financial Director","fiscalYear":2024,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"compensationAsOfEpochDate":1735603200,"executi